    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Could you expand a bit more on that third point—the credit and banking practices? I'm curious about how merchants actually managed risk or handled payments when they were traveling through such long, dangerous stretches of territory.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
